<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss December unemployment rate 5.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Swiss December unemployment rate 5.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.3 percent in December, up from 5.1 percent the prior month, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>The average unemployment rate for all of 1996 was 4.7 percent, up from an average 4.2 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>					  Dec 1996   Nov 1996   Dec 1995</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed    5.3	  5.1	  4.3</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  192,171    183,026    157,115</p>
<p> Job vacancies			4,488	5,218	3,702</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
